```java
public final class BankAccount {
    private final String owner;
    private final long balanceInCents;

    public BankAccount(String owner, long balanceInCents) {
        if (owner == null || owner.isBlank()) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("owner is required");
        }
        if (balanceInCents < 0) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("balance must not be negative");
        }
        this.owner = owner;
        this.balanceInCents = balanceInCents;
    }
}
```

要点有三条：

- 所有校验都排在赋值之前，异常抛出时不会留下部分写入的字段；
- 字段声明为 `final`，构造完成后无法再被改写，不变量更难被破坏；
- 非法参数用 `IllegalArgumentException` 明确失败，而不是悄悄改成 `0` 或空字符串。

当“余额省略时按 0 处理”时，容易写出两份重复校验。更稳妥的写法是让参数较少的构造器委托给参数完整的构造器：

```java
public BankAccount(String owner) {
    this(owner, 0L);
}

public BankAccount(String owner, long balanceInCents) {
    if (owner == null || owner.isBlank()) {
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("owner is required");
    }
    if (balanceInCents < 0) {
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("balance must not be negative");
    }
    this.owner = owner;
    this.balanceInCents = balanceInCents;
}
```

`this(owner, 0L)` 必须是该构造器的第一条语句，并且一个构造器只能委托一次。这样校验和赋值只存在一份，将来修改规则时不会漏改某个入口。

下面两个构造器各自复制了一份 `name` 校验。请改写为委托形式，并说明改写后哪些行为保持不变。

```java
public Person(String name) {
    if (name == null || name.isBlank()) throw new IllegalArgumentException("name is required");
    this.name = name;
    this.age = 0;
}

public Person(String name, int age) {
    if (name == null || name.isBlank()) throw new IllegalArgumentException("name is required");
    if (age < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("age must not be negative");
    this.name = name;
    this.age = age;
}
```

判断标准：单参构造器改为 `this(name, 0)` 委托；`name` 校验只保留一处；`new Person("")` 与 `new Person("Ann", -1)` 仍然抛出异常。
